---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const seo = [
  ['endosfēra','4.8'],['vakuuma masāža','5.2'],['lāzerepilācija','6.1'],['лазерная эпиляция рига','6.4'],['lāzerepilācija vīriešiem','2.3'],['endosfera riga','1.5'],['laser hair removal riga','3.1']
];
const related = [
  ['META ADS','2,970 enquiries in 8 months','Paid social acquisition through seasonality and changing demand.'],
  ['GOOGLE ADS','1,343 conversions','Capturing patients already searching for Epiline services.'],
  ['SEO','From search to enquiries','Building non-branded visibility across Latvian and Russian.'],
  ['WEBSITE','A complete rebuild','A new bilingual website built around services, search and conversion.'],
  ['CRM & BOOKING','Lead → appointment','Connecting Kommo CRM with Altegio to close the follow-up gap.']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Epiline case study | RM CREATIVES" description="How RM CREATIVES built Epiline's patient acquisition system across Meta Ads, Google Ads, SEO, website, CRM and online booking.">
<main>
  <section class="hero shell">
    <div class="top eyebrow"><span>EPILINE / FULL-STACK GROWTH</span><span>RIGA · JURMALA</span></div>
    <h1>One client.<br/>One system.<br/><em>Years of growth.</em></h1>
    <div class="intro"><p>We’ve worked with Epiline since before RM CREATIVES existed as an agency. What began as hands-on marketing grew into a complete patient acquisition infrastructure.</p><div class="tags eyebrow">META ADS · GOOGLE ADS · SEO · WEBSITE · CRM · ONLINE BOOKING</div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="metrics"><div class="shell metric-grid">
    <div><strong>2,970</strong><span>Meta enquiries<br/>Jan–Aug 2026</span></div>
    <div><strong>€5.85</strong><span>average<br/>Meta CPL</span></div>
    <div><strong>1,343</strong><span>Google Ads conversions<br/>Jan–Aug 2026</span></div>
    <div><strong>$5.35</strong><span>average<br/>Google Ads CPA</span></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="story shell"><span class="eyebrow">THE PARTNERSHIP</span><div><h2>The relationship started<br/>before the agency.</h2><p class="lead">Our work with Epiline goes back to 2018–2019, when Ilya worked directly with the business as its marketer. When RM CREATIVES was formed, the project moved into the agency — and the relationship kept growing.</p><p>Instead of changing suppliers every time the business needed something new, we gradually built the infrastructure around it: advertising, search, organic acquisition, website, booking and CRM.</p><blockquote>One business. Multiple growth problems.<br/>One long-term partner.</blockquote></div></section>

  <section class="channel dark"><div class="shell split"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / META ADS</span><h2>Predictable acquisition,<br/>not a lucky month.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>Meta remains one of Epiline’s core acquisition channels. Between January and August 2026, campaigns generated <b>2,970 enquiries</b> at an average cost of approximately <b>€5.85 per enquiry</b>.</p><p>We manage the channel continuously through high season, low season, changing services and offers. The objective is not one spectacular Ads Manager screenshot. It is acquisition that remains useful to the business over time.</p></div></div></section>

  <section class="channel shell"><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / GOOGLE ADS</span><h2>Capture demand<br/>that already exists.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>Meta creates and captures interest. Google catches people who are already looking for the service.</p><div class="big">1,343 <small>conversions</small></div><div class="big">$5.35 <small>average CPA</small></div><p>January–August 2026.</p></div></div></section>

  <section class="seo"><div class="shell"><div class="seo-head"><span class="eyebrow">03 / SEO</span><h2>Demand you don’t have<br/>to buy every month.</h2><p>Organic visibility is built around real treatment demand in both Latvian and Russian — not just the Epiline brand name.</p></div><div class="rankings">{seo.map(([q,p]) => <div><span>{q}</span><strong>#{p}</strong></div>)}</div><div class="content-proof"><div><strong>310</strong><span>organic clicks</span><p>Endospheres FAQ article</p></div><div><strong>282</strong><span>organic clicks</span><p>Vacuum massage guide</p></div><div><strong>211</strong><span>organic clicks</span><p>Endospheres reviews page</p></div></div><p class="source eyebrow">GOOGLE SEARCH CONSOLE · JAN–AUG 2026 · AVERAGE POSITION</p></div></section>

  <section class="website shell"><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / WEBSITE · 2025</span><h2>We threw the old<br/>website away.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>In 2025 we built the current Epiline website from scratch instead of endlessly modifying the old one.</p><p>A new bilingual structure for Riga and Jurmala, commercial service pages, SEO content and online booking — designed as one conversion layer for paid and organic traffic.</p><p>Because an established website already owns search visibility, SEO migration was part of the rebuild from the beginning. The new website had to move the brand forward without throwing away years of accumulated organic demand.</p><a class="link" href="https://epiline.lv/">VISIT EPILINE.LV ↗</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="crm dark"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">05 / CRM & ONLINE BOOKING</span><h2>A lead isn’t<br/>an appointment.</h2><div class="crm-grid"><div class="flow"><span>AD / WEBSITE</span><b>↓</b><span>LEAD</span><b>↓</b><span>KOMMO CRM</span><b>↓</b><span>FOLLOW-UP</span><b>↓</b><span>BOOKING</span><b>↓</b><span>ALTEGIO</span></div><div class="copy"><p>Altegio manages appointments, schedules and existing customers. But a person who has just submitted a form is still a potential customer — someone needs to call, follow up, set a task and keep working with them until they are ready.</p><p>We connected Kommo CRM with Altegio. New enquiries enter Kommo, the manager works with the lead and can create an Altegio appointment directly from the CRM while keeping follow-up tasks and reminders in Kommo.</p><blockquote>We closed the gap between “we received a lead” and “the patient booked”.</blockquote></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="conclusion shell"><span class="eyebrow">THE SYSTEM</span><h2>The important number<br/>isn’t 2,970.</h2><p>The real result is that Epiline does not depend on a single acquisition channel. Meta brings demand. Google captures intent. SEO builds long-term visibility. The website converts traffic. Kommo manages potential patients. Altegio manages appointments.</p><div class="timeline"><strong>2018/19</strong><i></i><strong>2026</strong></div><h3>We didn’t run a campaign.<br/>We built the system around the business.</h3></section>

  <section class="related shell"><div class="related-head"><span class="eyebrow">RELATED EPILINE CASES</span><h2>One client.<br/>Five deeper stories.</h2></div><div class="related-grid">{related.map(([tag,title,desc]) => <article><span class="eyebrow">{tag}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p><span class="soon eyebrow">DETAILED CASE →</span></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="cta shell"><span class="eyebrow">BUILD THE SYSTEM</span><h2>Need more than<br/>another campaign?</h2><a href="/contact">Discuss a project ↗</a></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
